    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s09-t01-mother-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s09-t01-mother-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26北京）某茶馆喝茶的客人中有50%还点了饼。所有客人中有60%的人喝茶、有40%的人点饼。则点饼的人中，喝茶的人占：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "75%"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "33%"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "96%"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "20%"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          90
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          84
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s09-t01-mother-02-p090.webp",
            "alt": "容斥问题 · 母题精讲2 · 讲义第84页",
            "pdfPage": 90
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s09-t01-mother-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s09-t01-mother-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看“喝茶的人中有50%点饼”，它的分母是喝茶的人。喝茶者占全部客人的60%，所以同时喝茶和点饼的人占全部客人的60%×50%＝30%。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "现在题目换成“点饼的人中”，分母改为占全部客人40%的点饼者，因此30%÷40%＝75%，我们选A。33%、96%、20%都不是这个条件范围下的占比。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "同一个交集不变，条件占比互换时需要换分母。"
        }
      ],
