    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s09-t01-mother-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s09-t01-mother-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（24江苏）某基层工会共有180名会员，举行甲、乙两项工会活动，60%的会员参加甲活动，50%的会员参加乙活动，若只参加甲活动的会员有80人，则只参加乙活动的会员有：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "10人"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "28人"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "62人"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "72人"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          90
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          84
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s09-t01-mother-03-p090.webp",
            "alt": "容斥问题 · 母题精讲3 · 讲义第84页",
            "pdfPage": 90
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s09-t01-mother-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s09-t01-mother-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先算参加甲活动的总人数180×60%＝108人。甲活动中只参加甲的有80人，因此两项都参加的有108−80＝28人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "参加乙活动的总人数为180×50%＝90人，减去也参加甲的28人，只有乙的就是90−28＝62人。所以我们选C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "“只甲”已知时，用甲总数减只甲先找到交集，再从乙总数中减掉交集。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
