    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s09-t01-practice-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "思维精练 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s09-t01-practice-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25国考）某研发小组员工中，60%的人参与了A项目，45%的人参与了B项目，两个项目都参与的人比两个项目都不参与的多2人。问该研发小组有多少人？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "100"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "50"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "40"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "20"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          90
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          84
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s09-t01-practice-01-p090.webp",
            "alt": "容斥问题 · 思维精练1 · 讲义第84页",
            "pdfPage": 90
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s09-t01-practice-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s09-t01-practice-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设总人数为N，两项都参与的有x人，两项都不参与的有y人。两者容斥给出N＝0.60N＋0.45N−x＋y，即x−y＝0.05N。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "题目恰好告诉我们x−y＝2，所以0.05N＝2，N＝40。代回60%和45%，分别是24人和18人，均为整数，因此我们选C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "两集合人数之和比总人数多多少，交集就比圈外多多少。"
        }
      ],
